{"steam_appid":2853590,"steam_name":"Void War","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2853590/762478/32e2e369cdacd45f2ab3c20fd2e172f61ab29248/1750820690/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1736816313","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257059364/b93e676d932c463eae37cefaf26af77c4b1f0823/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1736816313","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/a710892e32d035878ff6a68d57ab181026d016a7/ss_a710892e32d035878ff6a68d57ab181026d016a7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770404391","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/ss_77e4f7948a322e758a499eb235985f4c8dadebb1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770404391","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/ss_80e505b695f44c1ebc29853f33836d19a54a50d1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770404391","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/dda673f892c393bde88a15fbdfd0ae6671d2c7c7/ss_dda673f892c393bde88a15fbdfd0ae6671d2c7c7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770404391","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/ss_2d328792bd74d3bb56f0fa7179297daa2871bef0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770404391"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/extras/414fa9955f857886e17931dfc76fd6af.poster.avif?t=1770404391\" width=590 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/extras/414fa9955f857886e17931dfc76fd6af.webm?t=1770404391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/extras/414fa9955f857886e17931dfc76fd6af.mp4?t=1770404391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command an ancient starship and fight your way to the heart of a dying Empire. Fend off attacks from demented cultists, craven space pirates, and xenophobic Imperial soldiers. Discover powerful artifacts and use them to build your ship into a fearsome war engine. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your starship is a mighty and terrible vessel, brimming with arcane technology and devastating weapons. Harness your ship's weapons, modules, and reactor power to maximize your combat potential.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Combos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange your upgrades into powerful combos and use them to surgically dismantle your enemies. But watch out. They can do exactly the same to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Crew</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlist crew from six different factions. Customize them with a vast array of wargear and engage in bloody, strategic boarding actions against enemy craft. Watch them crush their foes or die horrifically in the frenzy of void warfare. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everchanging Galaxy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience hundreds of randomly generated encounters. Navigate through a brutal and unrelenting galaxy, weaving together a new story with every run.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark Techno-Gothic Future</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet technocultist magi, Imperial deserters, demon lords and more. Recruit them, fight them, and make choices that impact the state of your ship and the lives of your crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/extras/cb1dfb25564286ccb0f06ea20dbebefe.poster.avif?t=1770404391\" width=590 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/extras/cb1dfb25564286ccb0f06ea20dbebefe.webm?t=1770404391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/extras/cb1dfb25564286ccb0f06ea20dbebefe.mp4?t=1770404391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/extras/1bacc6917b52728ce440d566a2802425.poster.avif?t=1770404391\" width=590 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/extras/1bacc6917b52728ce440d566a2802425.webm?t=1770404391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/extras/1bacc6917b52728ce440d566a2802425.mp4?t=1770404391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/extras/ed00f83c76999f647db9ad7037eb8681.poster.avif?t=1770404391\" width=590 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/extras/ed00f83c76999f647db9ad7037eb8681.webm?t=1770404391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/extras/ed00f83c76999f647db9ad7037eb8681.mp4?t=1770404391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/extras/69790d0de4a06dfc2fc27f27f972e612.poster.avif?t=1770404391\" width=590 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/extras/69790d0de4a06dfc2fc27f27f972e612.webm?t=1770404391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853590/extras/69790d0de4a06dfc2fc27f27f972e612.mp4?t=1770404391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 3.0 GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie","RPG","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Tundra"],"publishers":["Tundra"],"release_date":"2 Jun, 2025"}